<p>Am häufig&#x017F;ten kommen die Kämme <hi rendition="#aq">h</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">m</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">n</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">o</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">g</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">f</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">s</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">t</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">u</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">v</hi><lb/>
